        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "bTT",
          "x": 88,
          "y": 750,
          "name": "wb-note",
          "clip": true,
          "width": 1324,
          "height": 120,
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "layout": "none",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bTP",
              "x": 18,
              "y": 16,
              "fill": "#000000",
              "content": "Why these cards and not a fixed layout",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bTQ",
              "x": 18,
              "y": 42,
              "fill": "#8E8E93",
              "content": "A chain's output type decides which cards appear. A Grouping brings the dendrogram and the family panels; an Encoding brings the image grid and the classifier confidence; a Scores brings the activity profile and its threshold.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bTR",
              "x": 18,
              "y": 62,
              "fill": "#8E8E93",
              "content": "So the workbench is not a dashboard someone has to configure — it is the seven interchange types, each knowing how it wants to be looked at.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bTS",
              "x": 18,
              "y": 88,
              "fill": "#007AFF",
              "content": "That is the part that makes the tool feel like it understands the analysis rather than merely running it.",
              "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
              "fontSize": 10,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ],
          "cornerRadius": 10,
          "stroke": "#E5E5EA",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "strokeAlignment": "inner"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "bTV",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -46,
      "fill": "#8E8E93",
      "content": "A  ·  film strip — the chain is the picture",
      "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "bTW",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": -46,
      "fill": "#8E8E93",
      "content": "B  ·  inspector — one stage, room to tune",
      "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "bTX",
      "x": 3120,
      "y": -46,
      "fill": "#8E8E93",
      "content": "C  ·  sweep — choose a parameter by eye",
      "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "bTY",
      "x": 4680,
      "y": -46,
      "fill": "#8E8E93",
      "content": "D  ·  compare — two chains, aligned",
      "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "bTZ",
      "x": 6240,
      "y": -46,
      "fill": "#8E8E93",
      "content": "E  ·  workbench — interrogate the output",
      "fontFamily": "Geist Mono",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontWeight": "normal"
    }
  ],
